---
// Work section — extracted from legacy index.html on 2026-05-20
---
<!-- ═══════════ CASE STUDIES ═══════════ -->
<section class="block" id="work">
  <div class="container container--wide">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">02 · Selected Work</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Flagship <em>engagements.</em></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Four projects that define the architectural patterns I keep returning to — headless commerce, regulated systems, ERP bridges, and identity infrastructure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cases">

      <!-- CASE 01 · RUST-OLEUM -->
      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case__visual">
          <div class="case__visual-meta">
            <div class="left"><strong>DWG · B–01</strong><span>React Hybrid / Page Builder</span></div>
            <div class="right"><strong>Fortune 500</strong><br>D2C · Coatings</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__shot">
            <img src="/assets/projects/rustoleum.png" alt="Rust-Oleum storefront — homepage screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="case__body">
          <div class="case__client"><strong>Rust-Oleum</strong> · Home</div>
          <h3 class="case__title">A storefront <em>through the ceiling.</em></h3>
          <div class="case__role">Role · <b>Principal Architect</b></div>

          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Challenge</div>
            <div class="case__row-v muted">Fortune-500 catalog stranded inside platform constraints. Marketing wanted Apple-grade product experiences; ops wanted to keep the BigCommerce checkout, tax, and ERP integrations they'd already paid for.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Solution</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">Designed a React hybrid page-builder experience for BigCommerce — a custom storefront layer embedded into the Page Builder workflow so marketing could compose experiences without losing checkout, tax, or back-of-house stability.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Tech</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip is-key">React</span>
                <span class="chip is-key">BigCommerce</span>
                <span class="chip">Page Builder</span>
                <span class="chip">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="chip">Tailwind CSS</span>
                <span class="chip">Stencil</span>
                <span class="chip">Node.js</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Impact</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="impact">
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">−68<small>%</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Time-to-PDP</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">0<small> req</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Platform Rip-out</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">F500</div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Catalog Scale</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- CASE 02 · DC iLOTTERY -->
      <article class="case case--alt reveal">
        <div class="case__visual">
          <div class="case__visual-meta">
            <div class="left"><strong>DWG · B–02</strong><span>Geofenced iGaming</span></div>
            <div class="right"><strong>Government</strong><br>Federal-Grade Compliance</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__shot">
            <img src="/assets/projects/dcilottery.png" alt="DC iLottery — geofenced iGaming platform screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="case__body">
          <div class="case__client"><strong>DC iLottery</strong> · Intralot</div>
          <h3 class="case__title">An app that <em>survives audit.</em></h3>
          <div class="case__role">Role · <b>Lead Architect</b></div>

          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Challenge</div>
            <div class="case__row-v muted">Build a high-security, government-regulated iGaming platform — native and web — for the District of Columbia's lottery. Every flow had to be defensible to a federal-grade regulator, every event had to be replayable, every wallet had to be enforceable.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Solution</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">Architected a hard-perimeter system: <em>geofencing</em> with layered GPS+IP signals, responsible-gaming workflows wired into every entry point, and an <em>immutable evidence framework</em> for post-hoc compliance reconstruction.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Tech</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip is-key">React Native</span>
                <span class="chip is-key">Node.js</span>
                <span class="chip">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="chip">AWS</span>
                <span class="chip">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="chip">Geofencing SDKs</span>
                <span class="chip">Crypto/KYC</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Impact</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="impact">
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">Fed<small>-grade</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Compliance</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">100<small>%</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Audit Re-runs</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">01</div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Jurisdiction</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- CASE 03 · NUUN -->
      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case__visual">
          <div class="case__visual-meta">
            <div class="left"><strong>DWG · B–03</strong><span>ERP ↔ Headless Bridge</span></div>
            <div class="right"><strong>10-Year Partnership</strong><br>Startup → Global</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__shot">
            <img src="/assets/projects/nuun.png" alt="Nuun — hydration brand storefront screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="case__body">
          <div class="case__client"><strong>Nuun</strong> · Hydration</div>
          <h3 class="case__title">Startup to <em>global, in stages.</em></h3>
          <div class="case__role">Role · <b>Technical Partner · 10 yrs</b></div>

          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Challenge</div>
            <div class="case__row-v muted">A category-defining brand growing past every commerce platform they tried. Each scale-jump risked breaking the ERP, inventory truth, and operational workflows that the warehouse and finance teams actually trusted.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Solution</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">Owned the <em>custom middleware</em> architecture between NetSuite and a headless Shopify storefront on Next.js — guiding the brand through three platform generations without ever taking inventory truth offline.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Tech</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip is-key">NetSuite</span>
                <span class="chip is-key">Shopify Headless</span>
                <span class="chip is-key">Next.js</span>
                <span class="chip">Celigo</span>
                <span class="chip">Node.js</span>
                <span class="chip">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="chip">Liquid</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Impact</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="impact">
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">10<small> yrs</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Partnership</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">03</div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Migrations</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">0<small> min</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">ERP Downtime</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- CASE 04 · AGEVERIFY -->
      <article class="case case--alt reveal">
        <div class="case__visual">
          <div class="case__visual-meta">
            <div class="left"><strong>DWG · B–04</strong><span>Identity SDK</span></div>
            <div class="right"><strong>Proprietary</strong><br>Privacy-First IDV</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__shot">
            <img src="/assets/projects/ageverify.png" alt="AgeVerify — privacy-first IDV SDK screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="case__body">
          <div class="case__client"><strong>AgeVerify</strong> · SDK</div>
          <h3 class="case__title">Identity, <em>without surveillance.</em></h3>
          <div class="case__role">Role · <b>Founder / Engineer</b></div>

          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Challenge</div>
            <div class="case__row-v muted">Regulated industries need verifiable age gates — but every off-the-shelf IDV vendor turns private documents into someone else's database. A proper boundary needed to be engineered, not configured.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Solution</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">Built a proprietary IDV <em>SDK/API</em> on Azure serverless infrastructure with a strict cryptographic privacy boundary — verification at the edge, no PII at rest, immutable proof for compliance without bulk data hoarding.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Tech</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip is-key">Azure Functions</span>
                <span class="chip is-key">Cosmos DB</span>
                <span class="chip is-key">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="chip">Node.js</span>
                <span class="chip">Crypto / Hashing</span>
                <span class="chip">React SDK</span>
                <span class="chip">REST / Webhooks</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__row">
            <div class="case__row-k">Impact</div>
            <div class="case__row-v">
              <div class="impact">
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">0<small> bytes</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">PII at Rest</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">&lt;200<small>ms</small></div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Cold Start</div>
                </div>
                <div class="impact__cell">
                  <div class="impact__v">B2B</div>
                  <div class="impact__k">Tenants</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
